<title>LEBANON: Lebanese money market rates detailed - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese money market rates detailed - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following money market details on Saturday.</p>
<p>Market in Lebanese pounds -</p>
<p>				 Dec 95  Sep 96  Oct 96   Nov 96</p>
<p>Avg rate on Deposits (%)  17.12   14.40   14.59    14.47</p>
<p>Estimated interest spread  3.33    3.72    3.07     2.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Estimated interest spread does not take into account operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>Market in Foreign Exchange -</p>
<p>Avge rate on Deposits (%)  5.46    5.47    5.56     5.59</p>
<p>Estimated interest spread  3.82    3.50    3.43     3.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Estimated interest spread does not take into account operating expenses and cost of capital. --Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
